.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-step-exists 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-step\-exists \- Print the presence lines a step\*(Aqs probed pathspecs select, the step cache\*(Aqs answer to the tool line
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten step exists\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIspecs\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the presence lines a step\*(Aqs probed pathspecs select, the step cache\*(Aqs answer to the tool line
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIspecs\fR>
The pathspecs, after `\-\-`: an `exists <path>` line per index path they select, `exists none` where none
